WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
In the last years of Eastern Han, the officials in Luoyang's court were arguing in an uproar, none submitting to another.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:08.942
Everyone at court was anxious, whispering among themselves.

00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:14.092
At this moment, Dong Zhuo led his army marching grandly into the city of Luoyang.

00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:18.234
The city gates opened, and the soldiers marched in, in a long line.

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:23.264
Dong Zhuo burst into the palace and seized control of the court; the little emperor trembled with fear.

00:00:23.614 --> 00:00:27.142
The officials stood to one side, heads bowed, hardly daring to breathe.

00:00:27.492 --> 00:00:32.820
He deposed Emperor Shao and installed Emperor Xian instead — all power was in his hands.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:36.842
From then on, Dong Zhuo alone decided all the court's great matters.

00:00:37.192 --> 00:00:42.520
Warlords everywhere raised their banners and rose in arms against Dong Zhuo's rule.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.422
As the news spread, common people everywhere felt uneasy.

00:00:46.772 --> 00:00:51.020
The central government could no longer control the regions, and the land split into piece after piece of rival power.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:55.930
A storm shrouded Luoyang — this chaos became the prelude to the Three Kingdoms era.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.288
And so, slowly, an age of turmoil began.

